      <simple-id uuid='{6D8EE846-93A9-41E1-A0D5-DFD5B8087026}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='Story of Vehicle Sales' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>Vehicle Sales</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='table'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#898989' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='story-description'>
          <format attr='background-color' id='story-description_11' value='#d4d4d4d9' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='font-weight' value='bold' />
          <format attr='background-color' value='#d3b348' />
          <format attr='color' value='#000000' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='story-title'>
          <format attr='color' value='#333333' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='97980' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99002' x='499' y='1010'>
            <zone h='6187' id='3' type-v2='title' w='99002' x='499' y='1010' />
            <zone h='12753' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='99002' x='499' y='7197' />
            <zone h='79040' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='99002' x='499' y='19950'>
              <flipboard active-id='3' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Transmission Types' captured-sheet='Dashboard transaction' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='price difference' captured-sheet='Dashboard price difference' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='top makes and odometer' captured-sheet='top makes according to total odometer' id='3' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='16667' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='29988' x='499' y='3157'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='12'>the pie chart shows that the total of selling price of automatic vehicles is much more than the total selling price of manual vehicles</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='43182' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='20948' x='40773' y='53662'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='12'>the line chart shows that the selling price of automatic vehicles per year make ismore than the selling price of manual vehicles per year make in the last 10 years and its selling price is expected to increase for the vehicles that will be made in the next 5 years.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='39773' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='16147' x='42706' y='58965'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='12'>the line chart shows that the total of price difference increases as the year that vehicle was made in increases and it is expected to increase more in the next 5 years.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='22222' hidden='true' id='9' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='14838' x='43204' y='36237'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='12'>the scatter plot shows that when odometer increases, the price difference decreases</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='20581' hidden='true' id='10' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='11658' x='87406' y='76641'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='12'>in CA and FI, the odometer of sold vehicles are the highest</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='20707' id='11' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='33292' x='50998' y='47980'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>according to total odometer, the top 3 vehicle companies are Ford, then Chevrolet, and then Nissan.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{152E9C3F-974F-4CB7-865F-E5CB06F8F077}' />
    </dashboard>
